EXPERIMENT 2: ONLINE HOTEL ROOM BOOKING SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an Online Hotel Room Booking System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to display available rooms, select room types, calculate booking costs, and confirm reservations.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage to display hotel details and available rooms.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display different room types with their prices and facilities.
5. Allow users to select a room type and enter check-in and check-out dates.
6. Accept the number of guests.
7. Calculate the total booking cost based on the room price and number of nights.
8. Validate the booking details before confirmation.
9. Display the booking summary and confirmation message.
10. Stop the program.
